# SPFx Dev Skills (Gated · SharePoint/spfx-dev-skills)

## When to use
- SPFx scaffold (Yeoman), version upgrade, gulp→Heft migration
- PnPjs / SharePoint list / Microsoft Graph data in web parts
- Heft/gulp build, serve, package-solution, manifest/config
- `.cursor/skills/spfx/SKILL.md` ဖတ်ပြီး intent အလိုက် **တစ်ခု** reference သာ load

## Hard gates (မချိုးရ)
1. **PJ toolchain** — SPFx **1.23** · **Heft** per `.yo-rc.json` / `package.json`; legacy gulp သာ ≤1.21.1
1a. **Invocation** — `heft` က PATH မှာ **မရှိ** (`node_modules/.bin/heft` သာ)။ npm scripts သာ ခေါ်: `npm run build:fast` · `npm run build` · `npm run test` · `npm run start:<wp>` · `npm run build:package`။ raw heft လိုရင် `npx heft <cmd>`။ `command not found: heft` = invocation မှား၊ **build failure မဟုတ်** — script name ပြန်စစ်ပြီး retry။
2. **Fluent UI split** — component/theme/icons/palette → `fluentui-gated.mdc` (ဒီ rule မခေါ်)
3. **Reject surfaces** — game canvas markup, legacy ASPX-only CSS; visual palette/typography → `fluentui-gated` + `react-design.md`
4. **No scaffold in wrong surface** — Yeoman create/upgrade refs ကို game/vanilla/ASPX ထဲ မခေါ်
5. **Upstream attribution** — adapted from [SharePoint/spfx-dev-skills](https://github.com/SharePoint/spfx-dev-skills) (MIT)

## Load order
1. `spfx/SKILL.md` (route table + PJ banner)
2. One of: `create` | `upgrade` | `pnpjs` | `toolchain` | `react-design`
3. `react-design.md` for UI shell → then `fluentui-gated` if Fluent components needed

## Intent routing
| User intent | Reference |
| --- | --- |
| New web part / extension | `references/create.md` |
| Upgrade SPFx version | `references/upgrade.md` |
| List/Graph/data access | `references/pnpjs.md` |
| build / serve / package / Heft | `references/toolchain.md` |
| Web part layout / a11y shell | `references/react-design.md` |

## Reject & rewrite
- Output က upstream v9 `FluentProvider` / `@fluentui/react-components` ဖြစ်နေရင် **reject** → `fluentui-gated` + v8 `ThemeProvider`
- `m365`/`yo` မရှိရင် **stop** — doctor output + install commands ပြပြီး ဆက်မလုပ်
